 "text": "Hey there, how are you? Not at all. Many restaurants include a tip with the check, so it looks like more than it is. Just be aware that the waiter will leave while we still eat. Each of you says a few words, and then splits the total that everyone agrees on. That way, no one feels hard done by. Roughly ten dollars per person per hour everyone is working. More if you' impressed. You' welcome. restaurant tip, and restaurant tipping, we've covered. Now your waiter won't leave yet. Ask her how much for the evening so everyone knows, and split it. Do it now, and no one feels hard done by.",
